      "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:31:52.527Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m trying to either build a custom dashboard or chart that can show me “Stock at a glance”, showing stock amounts of items that I have in inventory without running a report. It could also be a table of Items that has a column showing the stock per warehouse. It’s important that this be a live amount, or at least live in the sense that it loads anytime I load the page.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
